8. _dumu_ ta-ak-ti 
#tr.ts: mār takti
#tr.en: son of Takti

9. _a-sza3_ a-na er-re-szu-tim 
#tr.ts: eqlam ana errēšūtim
#tr.en: the field in tenancy

10. a-na _gu2-un_ 
#tr.ts: ana biltim 
#tr.en: for rent 

11. a-na _mu 1(disz)-kam_ 
#tr.ts: ana ištēt šattim
