#tr.ts: waraḫ ayyarim ūmam ištenum
#tr.en: The month of Ayyarum, the day 1,

13. _mu_ am-mi-s,a-du-qa2 _lugal-e [sipa zi sze-ga?] {d}utu [{d}]amar#-utu-[bi-da-ke4?]_ 
#tr.ts: šanat ammi-ṣaduqa šarrum rē'um kīnum šēmûm ša šamaš u marduk
